; Guard release timer: guard 4 (word, part of GuardTimers)
;
; The fourth word of the four-word array GuardTimers that starts at #R$6DA6 (see there for the meaning and for who sets
; and counts it). It belongs to the guard whose record is at #R$6E64. Initial value after #R$6A22: 4*n*256 passes (n =
; game pace #R$7C62, 8 at the start of a game).
;
g$6DAC DEFW $0000
